OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight and staying mostly dry
OL,8,Fexcept for a few light showers around
OL,9,Fthe coasts. Mist and fog may form in
OL,10,Fthe south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAny mist and fog clearing in
OL,13,Fthe morning to leave a largely dry day
OL,14,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping. The odd shower around the
OL,16,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
